Error [jet.MarkedFunctionValue]: `bump` can't be used as a function value because its parameter `x` is `&`
  --> tests/ui/marked_function_value.jet:25:26
    |
 25 |     hooks: Hooks{on_int: bump, on_text: consume}
    |                          ^^^^
 Why: A function type gives each parameter plain read access, so a value of `bump` would drop the `&` its callers must write
 Fix: Call `bump` directly with the `&` mark, or pass a lambda that makes that call
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0227

Error [jet.MarkedFunctionValue]: `consume` can't be used as a function value because its parameter `s` is `^`
